    date: "2026-08-06"
    author: "Claude"
    changes:
      - "Added ClassTeachingIsARelationship (A-74 co-teaching) — teacher<->class lives in user_tags/class_teachers; classes.teacher_user_id is a demoted LEAD POINTER, never ownership"
      - "Server guards ask 'is this an active teacher of this class?' (relationship OR lead): create-class-join-code, create-class-learner; teacher class lists (classes GET, me GET) union co-taught classes so a co-teacher is never silently empty"
      - "Class creation DUAL-WRITES the CLASS:<id>/teacher tag alongside the lead pointer (api/_utils/classTeacherTag.ts), with honest failure — 500 on the teacher API, class rollback in onboarding"
      - "school/remove-staff CASCADES to class-level teacher tags and hands on the lead pointer — a removed teacher previously kept pupil-data visibility via resolveVisibleScope"
